# COMPONENT

## Cqrs

### PACKAGE

org.sample.cqrs

### DESCRIPTION

CQRS sample component for item management.

### SPECIFICATION

This component demonstrates a visible split between a command side and a query side.

### DOMAIN_INTENT

Two runtime surfaces are modeled:
1. Command side (`Item` service): create an item through the job-backed command path.
2. Query side (`Item` service): read item state through the immediate query path.

### LIFECYCLE

Typical flow:
1. `createItem` on the command side
2. `getItem` on the query side

# SERVICE

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Item-facing CQRS operations.

### OPERATION

#### createItem

##### DESCRIPTION

Creates a new item through the command side.

##### IN

Item creation payload.

##### OUT

Command job result.

#### getItem

##### DESCRIPTION

Reads an item through the query side.

##### IN

Identifier of the item to retrieve.

##### OUT

Current item state.

# ENTITY

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Shared item entity used by both command and query sides.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

# COMMAND

## CreateItem

### DESCRIPTION

Command to create an item.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| name  | name   | 1            |
| title | string | 1            |

# QUERY

## GetItem

### DESCRIPTION

Query to read an item.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type     | multiplicity |
|------|----------|--------------|
| id   | entityid | 1            |

# OPERATION

## createItem

### TYPE
COMMAND

### INPUT
CreateItem

### OUTPUT
CreateItemResult

## getItem

### TYPE
QUERY

### INPUT
GetItem

### OUTPUT
ItemResult
